# Example Workshop

> Example Workshop publishes guides and specifications for its fictional workbench planner.

Use the facts page for entity details and the specifications page for supported measurements.

## Reference

- [Facts](https://example.com/about/facts): Publisher and product facts with supporting sources.
- [Specifications](https://example.com/specifications): Formats, measurements, and limitations.

## Optional

- [Guides](https://example.com/guides): Worked planning examples.
